{\pard \par}{\pard{\i Note.} {\i df\sub Num\nosupersub} indicates degrees of freedom numerator. {\i df\sub Den\nosupersub} indicates degrees of freedom denominator. Epsilon indicates Greenhouse-Geisser multiplier for degrees of freedom, 
